       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\nIbuprofen 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. That is twice the usual maximum for inpatients, which is 3,200 mg/day, and four times the typical OTC limit. At that level the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury and cardiovascular events rises sharply, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **400 mg PO four times daily** (1,600 mg/day)\n- **800 mg PO three times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **1600 mg/day total**, divided differently\n\nTell me which one you want, or confirm that you really intend 1600 mg four times daily, and I'll enter it right away. If you confirm the original dose, I'll add a note that it was verified with you."
